# Title -> "Start new game" (second item) -> "overwrite autosave?" -> Start -> opening sequence.
# Overwrites only the isolated dev save (back it up first). Used to time the opening cutscene.
# D-pad taps are kept short: menu key-repeat appears to count frames, so long holds repeat at high FPS.
